    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subverting the famous figures of Eastern history </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combines many famous historical figures of the East, allowing you to experience the dream moment of being like-minded with the heroes.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play card combinations and hero summoning </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon heroes, collect cards, cultivate heroes, and add skill cards and equipment cards to hero cards to strengthen their abilities, making the game rich and diversified.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Funny Riding System </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Funny and Cute Riding System in the history of the game! Whether it's a red rabbit horse, a water dragon head or a panda head, choose your favorite horse and ride around the world to maximize your ideas!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique A.RPG Battle System </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cMystina : Heroes Online\u201d adopts a closed real-time battle system, with random access to the battlefield, completely real-time battles, and A.PRG battles that can show a variety of attack strategies.</strong></p>",
